{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>What</b> — Let him comfort his soul. The sense of 'the salvations of His face' is on the pattern of 'His right hand saves him,' by way of parable. Or 'salvations' is a noun of action with 'His face,' as in 'the face of YHWH is their portion'; and the word את or עם is missing."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {0 "Resolved the unmarked biblical quotation in 'as in…' to Lamentations 4:16 (פני ה׳ חלקם); Ibn Ezra cites it without a source reference."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:34.277007580Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}